WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.890
[Soft Curious Piano Intro]

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:15.500
I'm sitting in the quiet

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.500
The storm has passed me by

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
She's holding me and breathing

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
And I don't have to cry

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.500
And in the peaceful after

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.000
I hear her ask my name

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.500
I say, "It's complicated"

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.000
She says, "Mine's the same."

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.500
She asks me what I'm taking

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.000
I wait for her to laugh

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.680
I tell her "Astrophysics"

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:54.000
That cold and broken path

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.500
My mother's "silly experiment"

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.000
The trap to make me fail

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.500
The math I'll never navigate

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.111
The wind without a sail

00:01:08.171 --> 00:01:13.500
But she just smiles and says "Me too!"

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.800
And my whole world just... stops

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.500
The pieces of my broken life

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.000
Are falling into slots

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.397
She doesn't see a failure

00:01:28.477 --> 00:01:31.500
She doesn't see a trap

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.200
She's pointing to the patterns

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.999
On a different kind of map

00:01:36.999 --> 00:01:45.144
[Gentle Piano Interlude]

00:01:45.144 --> 00:01:47.800
She talks about the "logic"

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.500
A "sanctuary" from the noise

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.000
A place where all the chaos

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.500
Follows a single voice

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:02.514
She's speaking in my language

00:02:02.574 --> 00:02:06.000
A language I forgot

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.500
She's not a part of mother's plan

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.000
She's something she could not...

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:19.000
And she just smiles and says "Me too!"

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.800
And my whole world just... stops

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:27.500
The pieces of my broken life

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.000
Are falling into slots

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.034
She doesn't see a failure

00:02:34.114 --> 00:02:37.500
She doesn't see a trap

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.000
She's pointing to the patterns

00:02:41.084 --> 00:02:45.505
Of the same constellations on our map

00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:54.000
The same constellations...

00:02:57.128 --> 00:03:01.000
She sees them too...

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:16.400
Me too...
